        startAltitudeM: 0,
        endAltitudeM: 0,
        description: "The journey begins early in the morning from Pune with pickups from Deccan and Hinjewadi. Trekkers will travel towards Bhira village, the base village for the Devkund Trek. The route passes through scenic highways, mountain roads, and lush green landscapes of the Western Ghats. Upon reaching Bhira village, you all will freshen up and prepare for the trek. The trek begins with easy forest paths and gradually passes through streams, muddy sections, rocky terrain, and open clearings. During monsoon season, you can witness numerous small waterfalls and flowing water streams throughout the route. The trek offers a peaceful jungle experience with dense greenery and fresh mountain air. The route includes several river crossings and scenic viewpoints that add adventure to the journey. After trekking for a few hours, you will finally reach Devkund Waterfall. The sight of the massive waterfall flowing into a crystal-clear natural pool creates a breathtaking experience. You can spend time relaxing near the waterfall, photography, and enjoying the peaceful atmosphere. The surrounding cliffs and forests make the location incredibly scenic. After spending sufficient time at the waterfall, the group begins the return trek towards Bhiravillage. Upon reaching the base village, you will enjoy a delicious lunch before boarding the vehicle back to Pune. By night, the group reaches Pune with unforgettable memories of waterfalls, forests, and monsoon adventures.",
