    howToReach: [{"title": "From Pune Pune acts as the primary starting point for reaching the Andharban Trek region.", "steps": ["1 Reach Pune Travel to Pune by train, bus, or flight. The city is well connected to major destinations across Maharashtra and nearby states.", "Reach Pune Travel to Pune by train, bus, or flight. The city is well connected to major destinations across Maharashtra and nearby states.", "2 Drive to Gutkha Village From Pune, begin a scenic drive toward Gutkha Village via Tamhini Ghat. The journey takes around 4-5 hours and offers beautiful views of valleys, waterfalls, and dense forest sections.", "Drive to Gutkha Village From Pune, begin a scenic drive toward Gutkha Village via Tamhini Ghat. The journey takes around 4-5 hours and offers beautiful views of valleys, waterfalls, and dense forest sections.", "3 Arrive and Trek Preparation Upon reaching Gutkha Village, meet the trek team, organize your gear, and prepare for the trek briefing before starting the trail.", "Arrive and Trek Preparation Upon reaching Gutkha Village, meet the trek team, organize your gear, and prepare for the trek briefing before starting the trail."]}, {"title": "From Gutkha Village Gutkha Village serves as the base point for beginning the famous Andharban Trek through the Sahyadri forests.", "steps": ["1 Begin Trek from Base Point Start the trek through dense forest trails, mist-covered paths, streams, and scenic valley sections.", "Begin Trek from Base Point Start the trek through dense forest trails, mist-covered paths, streams, and scenic valley sections.", "2 Experience the Andharban Forest Trail The route is known for its lush greenery, monsoon landscapes, and peaceful jungle surroundings, making it one of the most scenic treks in Maharashtra.", "Experience the Andharban Forest Trail The route is known for its lush greenery, monsoon landscapes, and peaceful jungle surroundings, making it one of the most scenic treks in Maharashtra.", "3 Complete Trek & Return Journey After completing the trek, trekkers usually continue toward the endpoint and begin the return journey back toward Pune.", "Complete Trek & Return Journey After completing the trek, trekkers usually continue toward the endpoint and begin the return journey back toward Pune."]}],
